# Legacy URL map — every page of the old ColdFusion site sent to its nearest
# replacement, so no existing link, bookmark or search result breaks.
#
# The first 50 rules are the pages crawled on the legacy site in 2026. The rest,
# added 2026-10-22, are older addresses the Wayback Machine knows, which still
# get requested. Where a page was consolidated into a section of a larger page,
# the redirect points at the page that absorbed it. Where a page was empty, it
# points at the page that now carries the content it should have had.
#
# Matching is exact and case-sensitive, and the old IIS server was not: so
# every mixed-case address also has its lower-case form, in the last section.
# tests/integration/build-output.test.ts fails if one is missing.
#
# Deliberately NOT redirected, so they stay honest 404s until the chapter
# decides: the Vietnam Medal of Honor honor roll (/Vietnam-MOH-Recipients and
# eight citation pages) and the Vince Kaspar prizes (/vkea.html,
# /Excellence-in-the-Arts), whose content has no page on the new site.
#
# Format: /source  /destination  status

